WEBVTT

00:03.000 --> 00:05.990
"Shuka \ City suburbs"

00:08.700 --> 00:10.270
That's right...

00:10.270 --> 00:11.740
Yes...

00:11.740 --> 00:14.010
I just verified...

00:14.010 --> 00:17.710
Judging by the armor and body stature,
I believe you're right...

00:19.550 --> 00:25.020
It looks like we were able to confirm the identity of the body we believe to be Lady Ulrika.

00:25.020 --> 00:26.580
Believe to be...?

00:28.260 --> 00:31.750
We couldn't find the head...

00:34.060 --> 00:39.230
There aren't many on this island who could kill Ulrika.

00:39.230 --> 00:44.370
It probably is Lou Chun Wah's doing...

00:44.370 --> 00:48.710
So you're finally accepting that this is Kouran's bidding!

00:48.710 --> 00:52.280
She has nothing to do with the Kouran forces!

00:52.280 --> 00:53.750
We're supposed to believe that?!

00:53.750 --> 00:58.920
As one of the Six Greats of Kouran, no lie will come from me!

00:58.920 --> 01:02.320
The combined expedition has been disbanded.

01:04.760 --> 01:11.570
In truth, both D'natia and Kouran sought the extermination of Red Dragon...

01:11.570 --> 01:17.060
...while the revolutionary army prepared an alliance with D'natia in secrecy.

01:20.110 --> 01:25.640
But Lady Ulrika believed in the expedition's ideal...

01:28.950 --> 01:32.120
...that Kouran and D'natia would join hands

01:32.120 --> 01:37.460
to save Nil Kamui's guardian deity, Red Dragon.

01:39.490 --> 01:42.830
Thus, as the final member of the combined expedition,

01:42.830 --> 01:49.770
I, Ka Grava Rai Fuu Gramstahl, have an obligation to carry on Lady Ulrika's will.

01:49.770 --> 01:55.870
I will not let any conflict between
Kouran and D'natia occur in my presence!

01:58.280 --> 02:03.050
<i>The heat-haze shimmers, ember-toned</i>

02:03.050 --> 02:07.490
<i>Its blurred afterimage far away</i>

02:07.490 --> 02:09.620
<i>(I'm back in this life)</i>

02:20.400 --> 02:29.740
<i>My shout added to the noise</i> <i>and disappeared into the chaos</i>

02:29.740 --> 02:30.750
<i>(Don't wait)</i>

02:30.750 --> 02:32.850
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:32.850 --> 02:35.920
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

02:35.920 --> 02:38.150
<i>One single life I choose to end</i>

02:38.150 --> 02:40.360
<i>In every breath I take it ends</i>

02:40.360 --> 02:44.590
<i>Defiling even this chosen fate</i>

02:44.590 --> 02:50.830
<i>With the blood of judgment</i>

02:50.830 --> 02:56.340
<i>"If I can just solve this unraveling</i> <i>moment with my own hands"</i>

02:56.340 --> 03:01.410
<i>I howled enough to burn my life out</i>

03:01.410 --> 03:07.080
<i>I left my hopes to an</i> <i>undependable past and vanished</i>

03:07.080 --> 03:12.690
<i>Cruelly enough, my voice was beautiful</i>

03:12.690 --> 03:16.720
<i>The ending world</i>

03:16.720 --> 03:21.590
<i>I'll be a judgment light</i>

03:28.970 --> 03:31.440
"Shuka \ Outskirts road"

03:35.240 --> 03:39.240
Her ride is on the house.
Think of it as charity.

03:40.480 --> 03:43.150
Setsuren? What a nice name.

03:43.150 --> 03:44.590
Thank you.

03:44.590 --> 03:47.220
So, you must be the Sherbet Company person.

03:47.220 --> 03:51.390
And big brother here is the newest member of the Black Dragon Knights, right?

03:51.390 --> 03:52.760
You're well known.

03:52.760 --> 03:56.660
Are you the daughter of some wealthy merchant?

03:58.430 --> 04:00.740
Okay, we can go with that.

04:00.740 --> 04:02.740
Go with...?

04:02.740 --> 04:08.080
Say, say, Sweallow?
There's something I want to ask you.

04:08.080 --> 04:10.250
Ah, what is it?

04:10.250 --> 04:15.910
Did you find what you were looking for on this remote island?

04:17.650 --> 04:20.660
It's true that I'm looking for something.

04:20.660 --> 04:24.090
Do you know what that "something" is?

04:24.090 --> 04:25.530
Not really...

04:25.530 --> 04:30.790
But let's see... Maybe something that will never break?

04:35.000 --> 04:36.670
You're right...

04:36.670 --> 04:43.010
Anything that I try to hold dear to me breaks no matter what.

04:43.010 --> 04:44.350
No...

04:44.350 --> 04:47.680
I guess it's more like anything in this world...

04:47.680 --> 04:49.880
You know, what if there was someone

04:49.880 --> 04:54.220
who could live thousands of years without a change in their appearance?

04:54.220 --> 04:59.690
Would that be the "something" that big brother is looking for?

04:59.690 --> 05:03.720
I may be able to give that "something" to you...

05:05.670 --> 05:07.800
Who are you?

05:17.150 --> 05:21.050
Hey, everyone! We're about to arrive in the capital city of Shuka.

05:23.580 --> 05:25.250
I see...

05:25.250 --> 05:28.920
The beast isn't healing its wounds as quickly as usual,

05:28.920 --> 05:32.490
and in turn, it's draining the life which it's bonded to.

05:32.490 --> 05:35.260
It must be because of the
Magic Territory shift to D'natia.

05:36.530 --> 05:38.500
Do you have any last words?

05:38.500 --> 05:41.740
If I see Ibuki, I can relay your words for you.

05:41.740 --> 05:45.940
I can't... die yet.

05:45.940 --> 05:47.540
Ibuki needs to...

05:47.540 --> 05:49.940
He doesn't desire that anymore.

05:49.940 --> 05:52.110
He's planning to make his younger sister the king.

05:52.110 --> 05:54.050
It doesn't matter...

05:54.050 --> 05:58.890
I've decided to make Ibuki king...

05:58.890 --> 06:00.380
I see...

06:02.390 --> 06:10.030
If you use this, the pain in your body can be neutralized with Kouran's magic.

06:10.030 --> 06:15.100
But using this wedge will only extend your life for a few days.

06:15.100 --> 06:16.770
Do you still want it?

06:21.540 --> 06:23.980
Okay, here...

06:31.650 --> 06:34.620
"Capital of Nil Kamui \ Shuka"

06:39.060 --> 06:42.050
"Guest house"

06:42.400 --> 06:47.100
What is the reason for expediting the execution of Agito?

06:47.100 --> 06:50.840
It's the condition we gave for Kouran's attendance at the peace meeting.

06:50.840 --> 06:53.010
Ka Grava!

06:53.010 --> 06:54.940
Sir Simeon!

06:54.940 --> 07:00.140
You have some gall to show yourself here after you left without any notice.

07:01.620 --> 07:05.320
Speaking of which, is Lady Ulrika attending the peace meeting?

07:05.320 --> 07:08.520
I see. So you haven't heard yet...

07:08.520 --> 07:12.690
Um, we overheard something about executing Agito...

07:14.160 --> 07:16.460
This is Sir Krama.

07:16.460 --> 07:19.460
He is the representative of the provisional government.

07:20.670 --> 07:22.640
Sir Sweallow, was it?

07:22.640 --> 07:27.680
Agito, who led the rebel army, is being held in prison here in Shuka.

07:27.680 --> 07:33.150
Recently, we found that he conspired to place a false king named Inori upon the throne.

07:33.150 --> 07:35.620
Because of this, we decided to execute him without trial.

07:35.620 --> 07:39.550
But the revolutionary army is supported by the citizens of Nil Kamui.

07:39.550 --> 07:41.620
Not "revolutionary army."

07:41.620 --> 07:45.290
That's "rebel army," big sister Meryl.

07:45.290 --> 07:47.030
Setsuren...?

07:47.030 --> 07:48.460
Sir Byakuei?

07:48.460 --> 07:53.470
If it was that kid Ibuki, then I'd let him proclaim himself to be king...

07:53.470 --> 07:54.970
...but not Inori.

07:54.970 --> 07:56.640
You know why, right?

07:56.640 --> 08:00.540
This is Kouran's representative, Lady Setsuren.

08:00.540 --> 08:02.010
Representative?

08:02.010 --> 08:03.180
Why, yes.

08:03.180 --> 08:06.210
Back in my country, I'm also known as the "spiritual mother," Líng Mŭ.

08:06.210 --> 08:09.350
Um, but why would the ruler come here?

08:09.350 --> 08:11.890
You would know...

08:11.890 --> 08:15.060
Where is Lou Chun Wah?

08:15.060 --> 08:16.490
Sir Simeon...?

08:16.490 --> 08:17.980
Where is she?!

08:20.860 --> 08:23.830
"Shuka \ Prison"

08:26.930 --> 08:30.670
Please speak with Agito directly.

08:34.580 --> 08:38.610
What's the meaning of this, Fugaku?

08:38.610 --> 08:42.410
Agito asked to speak with Lord Ibuki in private.

08:50.020 --> 08:57.300
I am Blenheim, a member of the Emperor of D'natia's personal order of cavaliers.

08:57.300 --> 09:01.790
I need to question you about the deaths of Bishop Enumael and the temple soldiers.

09:05.540 --> 09:11.450
If Agito is going to be executed,
Inori and Ibuki are sure to come to Shuka.

09:11.450 --> 09:14.880
They'll then summon Red Dragon to save him.

09:14.880 --> 09:19.390
Summon? I believe Red Dragon went on a rampage of its own accord.

09:19.390 --> 09:22.260
That's so unlike you, great merchant.

09:22.260 --> 09:27.260
A young girl is always sighted before Red Dragon goes on a rampage.

09:27.260 --> 09:29.660
And that's Inori...?

09:29.660 --> 09:32.130
Say, big brother Sweallow?

09:32.130 --> 09:35.830
If Red Dragon appears, can you please leave it alone?

09:37.970 --> 09:39.670
How come?

09:39.670 --> 09:43.280
If we leave it alone, this city is going to be in a whole lot of trouble.

09:43.280 --> 09:46.310
But if big brother Sweallow kills it,

09:46.310 --> 09:50.020
the power of Red Dragon is going to be absorbed by Black Dragon.

09:50.020 --> 09:54.260
After all, Black Dragon and big brother are bonded by contract.

09:54.260 --> 09:58.290
That's a bit of a problem for me.

09:58.290 --> 10:04.870
Your country once defeated a dragon and built an advanced civilization with its power.

10:04.870 --> 10:09.340
Why, yes! Humans should be the ones to use the power of dragons.

10:09.340 --> 10:13.310
So what does Sir Sweallow get in return?

10:13.310 --> 10:17.840
Didn't I make it clear that I know what big brother wants?

10:18.810 --> 10:23.440
Yes, something everlasting, that would never break...

10:29.660 --> 10:33.360
I'm able to stay in this youthful form until I die.

10:33.360 --> 10:37.670
I can bring about the same for your precious someone, too.

10:37.670 --> 10:40.900
Give them an existence that would never break.

10:40.900 --> 10:42.390
How about it?

10:46.040 --> 10:48.540
Why don't you ask him, too?

10:48.540 --> 10:53.670
Say that you want to stay in your form forever.

10:55.320 --> 10:58.050
Then maybe he'll actually touch you...

11:01.020 --> 11:05.490
--Whoops...
--That's my answer, Líng Mŭ.

11:05.490 --> 11:08.330
I can now say I value the concept

11:08.330 --> 11:13.730
that with everything that breaks, something new is born.

11:13.730 --> 11:18.910
If you like, I can try to break you.

11:18.910 --> 11:22.540
Sweallow Clazzvali...

11:23.780 --> 11:27.550
"Líng Mŭ \ Many tyrants have dominated the

11:23.780 --> 11:27.550
continent of Kouran, but only the 'husbands' of

11:23.780 --> 11:27.550
the Líng Mŭ are recorded in history as Emperors.

11:23.780 --> 11:27.550
Those not received by the Líng Mŭ are labeled

11:23.780 --> 11:27.550
merely as supreme rulers. It is said that the

11:23.780 --> 11:27.550
Líng Mŭ is an aggregate form of wisdom from

11:23.780 --> 11:27.550
all the kings that have ever ruled Kouran."

11:29.920 --> 11:32.350
You've grown well, Ibuki.

11:34.090 --> 11:36.020
Thank you for coming down here.

11:38.390 --> 11:40.090
Teacher...

11:41.260 --> 11:42.750
Agito...

11:43.860 --> 11:47.070
There's something you need to do before you can become king.

11:47.070 --> 11:50.700
I thought you wanted Inori to become king?

11:52.910 --> 11:56.480
Kill Inori with your own hands.

11:56.480 --> 11:58.540
That will establish your right to become king.

12:07.920 --> 12:09.720
Fugaku, do you know what you're doing?!

12:09.720 --> 12:12.460
This is all going according to Agito's plan.

12:12.460 --> 12:17.160
Agito informed us that you would come to this prison.

12:17.160 --> 12:19.300
I assume it's his way of pleading for his life.

12:19.300 --> 12:20.740
Agito...

12:20.740 --> 12:22.740
That's right... Agito...

12:22.740 --> 12:24.570
Agito went and...

12:24.570 --> 12:28.110
Inori was cursed like me by Red Dragon.

12:28.110 --> 12:30.850
She went mad because of it.

12:30.850 --> 12:33.780
I want Inori back the way she was.

12:33.780 --> 12:34.850
Killing her is...!

12:34.850 --> 12:36.420
You've got it wrong.

12:36.420 --> 12:39.820
Inori made Red Dragon go mad.

12:39.820 --> 12:41.690
What...?

12:41.690 --> 12:46.290
Half a year ago, Inori was hiding in a certain village.

12:46.290 --> 12:50.660
But they found out who she was, and in fear of being chased by Kouran,

12:50.660 --> 12:53.030
the villagers tried to kill her.

13:07.950 --> 13:10.440
Then, from within Inori...

13:19.960 --> 13:22.190
...Red Dragon appeared.

13:29.740 --> 13:37.480
By the time we arrived, we found Red Dragon burning down the village at Inori's command.

13:37.480 --> 13:41.070
It was then I knew she had gone mad.

13:48.320 --> 13:50.590
Red Dragon?!

13:50.590 --> 13:52.890
Agito...!

13:52.890 --> 13:56.830
How dare you kill Father and Mother?!

13:56.830 --> 13:58.900
Finally remembered, did you?

13:58.900 --> 14:05.840
The death of your parents, the king and queen, three years ago wasn't because of Kouran...

14:05.840 --> 14:07.370
I killed them!

14:08.380 --> 14:12.610
The king was planning to bring about a false state of peace

14:12.610 --> 14:15.520
by offering Nil Kamui to D'natia and Kouran.

14:15.520 --> 14:17.920
That is not the kind of country I desire!

14:17.920 --> 14:20.390
That's why I killed the king!

14:20.390 --> 14:23.020
Agito... It can't be...

14:23.020 --> 14:27.430
But when I met Inori in that village, she smiled at me...

14:27.430 --> 14:33.700
That's how I found out that Inori wasn't the same as before.

14:33.700 --> 14:35.940
I won't forget this time...

14:35.940 --> 14:38.600
Red Dragon... Kill Agito!

14:41.640 --> 14:43.880
Ibuki! Kill Inori!

14:43.880 --> 14:46.550
That is the only way to stop Red Dragon!

14:46.550 --> 14:51.650
And then you will become known as the king who defeated Red Dragon!

14:53.890 --> 14:55.380
Agito!

15:01.260 --> 15:02.750
Fugaku!

15:05.600 --> 15:08.590
Ibuki... Hurry and use Red Dragon's power...!

15:09.600 --> 15:12.510
If you still see me as your friend...

15:12.510 --> 15:14.580
Of course you're my friend, Fugaku!

15:14.580 --> 15:17.740
Offer my life, and stop Inori...!

15:21.480 --> 15:25.280
Red Dragon! Grant me your power!

15:29.020 --> 15:34.500
Red Dragon approved of me! That's why your voice won't be heard, dear brother!

15:34.500 --> 15:36.100
Now, come with me.

15:36.100 --> 15:38.930
Stop, Inori! Fugaku is going to...!

15:38.930 --> 15:41.100
Hmm... What to do...

15:41.100 --> 15:47.040
I can let him live as a Returned One, since he is your precious friend...

15:47.040 --> 15:48.810
Ibuki!

15:49.940 --> 15:51.440
Or maybe not...

15:53.380 --> 15:56.320
Fugaku...!

16:01.820 --> 16:03.360
There you are.

16:03.360 --> 16:07.060
Simeon and the others are looking all over for you.

16:07.060 --> 16:08.860
Did you do something?

16:08.860 --> 16:10.700
Maybe, maybe not...

16:10.700 --> 16:14.500
That aside, I heard that our Líng Mŭ spoke with you.

16:14.500 --> 16:15.740
Yeah...

16:15.740 --> 16:18.040
She told me to leave Red Dragon alone.

16:18.040 --> 16:21.480
I assume you're not going to listen...

16:21.480 --> 16:27.410
To be honest, I don't care who defeats
Red Dragon as long as Ibuki's curse is lifted.

16:27.410 --> 16:30.750
That being the case, wouldn't it be better if we joined forces?

16:30.750 --> 16:32.920
That would defeat the purpose...

16:32.920 --> 16:36.080
That dragon's life is for my lord...

16:39.560 --> 16:43.730
Our powers will cancel each other out and we'll be on even ground.

16:43.730 --> 16:45.670
Only this island will suffer.

16:45.670 --> 16:47.930
We're not equals in the first place!

16:50.340 --> 16:51.870
Now, Lou!

16:51.870 --> 16:55.070
He still doesn't know of Ulrika's death.

17:07.050 --> 17:09.390
Sweallow...!

17:09.390 --> 17:13.860
So, Ulrika died...

17:13.860 --> 17:16.060
Things will always break.

17:16.060 --> 17:19.530
That fact is obvious to him.

17:19.530 --> 17:22.900
That's why he sees things as precious, and tries to stop them from breaking...

17:22.900 --> 17:25.900
But there's no time for him to look back on things which are already broken.

17:27.310 --> 17:29.710
Contract seal, release...

17:31.610 --> 17:35.150
It came...! It finally arrived!

17:35.150 --> 17:37.380
What?! What's going on?!

17:45.760 --> 17:48.160
Inori... What have you done?!

17:48.160 --> 17:52.170
Today's going to be our day of independence!

17:52.170 --> 17:54.830
And then, dear brother and I are going to bond as one!

17:55.900 --> 17:57.340
What are you saying?!

17:57.340 --> 18:00.600
A king can do anything they want, you know?

18:04.240 --> 18:06.010
I see...

18:06.010 --> 18:09.750
So, my old friend is being controlled by Inori after all.

18:12.590 --> 18:15.090
I will release my contract seal!

18:15.090 --> 18:17.690
All those still alive, leave at once!

18:17.690 --> 18:20.630
After all that talk about making me king...

18:20.630 --> 18:22.630
You're such a liar, D'natia!

18:22.630 --> 18:24.800
Contract seal, release!

18:24.800 --> 18:27.460
Black Blade!

18:30.600 --> 18:31.770
Is that it?

18:31.770 --> 18:33.340
Wow, lame...

18:33.340 --> 18:34.830
Simeon!

18:37.610 --> 18:40.650
I'm the one who'll defeat Red Dragon...

18:40.650 --> 18:42.450
Black Dragon!

18:42.450 --> 18:46.990
I beseech you for your divine protection twice over!

18:46.990 --> 18:48.890
Two contract seals?!

18:56.360 --> 18:58.830
Black Dragon!

19:11.150 --> 19:13.710
Dear brother...

19:13.710 --> 19:16.980
Do I have to kill her...?

19:16.980 --> 19:18.550
Red Dragon...

19:18.550 --> 19:20.250
Red Dragon...!

19:20.250 --> 19:22.320
It won't answer me...?!

19:22.320 --> 19:24.320
Don't worry...

19:24.320 --> 19:26.990
Red Dragon is right here.

19:29.760 --> 19:32.170
Ibuki!

19:32.170 --> 19:33.330
Eykha!

19:33.330 --> 19:35.700
You don't have to dirty your hands!

19:35.700 --> 19:39.510
I'm your sword!

19:39.510 --> 19:40.570
Eykha!

19:40.570 --> 19:42.680
You're not my sword!

19:42.680 --> 19:46.080
You're the one I care for the most!

19:55.190 --> 19:58.530
Red Dragon is inside me.

19:58.530 --> 20:03.400
Neither I nor Red Dragon can be destroyed.

20:03.400 --> 20:04.530
Ibuki...

20:04.530 --> 20:06.430
Please listen to my song...

20:08.370 --> 20:10.700
The Song of a Bound One...

20:10.700 --> 20:15.440
A magic that changes one's life force into attack power...

20:15.440 --> 20:18.640
So, she's prepared to die...

20:57.990 --> 20:59.920
Red Dragon!

21:07.590 --> 21:11.600
Red Dragon will continue to revive...

21:11.600 --> 21:14.030
...so long as Inori is alive.

21:14.030 --> 21:18.530
But no attacks can reach her because of Red Dragon's divine protection...

21:19.770 --> 21:21.440
This isn't good...

21:21.440 --> 21:24.710
I will bring down Red Dragon for my lord...

21:27.480 --> 21:30.180
Please use my life...

21:30.180 --> 21:31.670
...Ibuki.

21:32.890 --> 21:36.380
I can't hear Red Dragon's voice anymore...

21:37.860 --> 21:39.290
But...!

21:39.290 --> 21:42.800
Imperial Era 3015, November...

21:42.800 --> 21:45.360
I... decided...

21:45.870 --> 21:46.330
"Act 11"

21:47.300 --> 21:50.570
"Act 11 \ Pandemonium"

21:57.640 --> 22:02.880
<i>The end I thought I'd chosen;</i> <i>though the melody may warp (more)</i>

22:02.880 --> 22:07.850
<i>At last the pounding heartbeat</i> <i>desires it and performs</i>

22:07.850 --> 22:13.090
<i>Both the evened-out impulse</i> <i>and the wiped-out lament (now)</i>

22:13.090 --> 22:19.560
<i>Are wings that race onward,</i> <i>tearing through the fog</i>

22:32.910 --> 22:42.860
<i>Emotions that can't be hidden in words</i> <i>that push people away (bleeding through)</i>

22:42.860 --> 22:48.060
<i>Emptying both hands so I can get what I want</i>

22:48.060 --> 22:55.560
<i>If I can't even find fault</i> <i>with this unshrinking expanse</i>

22:56.770 --> 22:58.310
<i>What am I supposed to believe?</i>

22:58.310 --> 23:02.480
<i>I need nothing if I have you:</i>
<i>That alone is enough</i>

23:02.480 --> 23:12.480
<i>Go on and cry: You burn so bright because</i> <i>the gears of transmigration are turning</i>

23:12.620 --> 23:22.620
<i>Tightly spin together the intertwining roads</i> <i>to which your shouts led you</i>

23:26.900 --> 23:27.330
"Act 12"

23:27.100 --> 23:31.410
Act 12: "One Chance in a Million."

23:31.410 --> 23:35.780
The city of Shuka burns, swallowing all with it.

23:35.780 --> 23:39.910
Fulfill your desire, Imperial!
